      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DARCY DAKOTA (3) brought up his 39th career win last start at Q Straight (18.61). Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Has a solid record from this box including four wins and a minor placing. In form and can go on with it. SOLICIT (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 390m (21.97). Yet to win here but has run some good races. Shapes as one to consider. PERKY PENNY (8) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Was sixth last time (17.69) over 300m at Casino in a Free For All. Has a good record here at this journey including six wins. The form from her last run stacks up well. Warrants plenty of respect. HERBIE SURE CAN (7) placed last time (19.91) at this track in a Grade 2/3, finishing third and beaten 2 lengths. Unbeaten in two runs from this draw.",
